// A filter inside a rule (spec §3.4, showcase §1): a customer may have fewer
// than five cancelled orders. The filter narrows `.orders`, and COUNT reduces
// the collection to a scalar — a bare collection can't be compared.
// The rule has no FROM: `.` is the customer being checked (`rule.recordTable`
// and `record` in the config).
//
//   minab check cancelled-orders-limit.minab
//   minab run cancelled-orders-limit.minab --trace

COUNT(.orders[.status == "cancelled"]) < 5
